From fc7f2ee1902bee5749e342f38834d70794bce896 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] LV7b: the levels audio kit, 6 songs and 12 synth sound
 effects

Six songs (SONG_SPA_BOSSA .. SONG_GREAT_RAIN, ids 29..34) in the MML form, bank cues
(classic.lock 228..231, common.lock 198/199), jukebox unlocks 726..731 (not granted yet),
12 synth one-shots after SFX_CREAK (0 B of PCM: the 48 KB budget is untouched), sfxgen.py
--synth audit. PS1: SONG_COUNT / SFX_SYNTH_END keep the old counts and its copy of the music
bank is the old bank byte for byte, so no resident byte. Tests: test_levels_audio.c, golden
rows for the new songs appended.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cvXV9YcGJn2CBo4zvt
